• PDA North America: pdanorthamerica.org — free PDA guide, webinars, peer support groups
• PDA Society UK: pdasociety.org.uk — online courses ($), practice guidance (free)
• Low Demand Parenting: lowdemandparenting.com — Amanda Diekman's courses and community
• Reframing Autism: reframingautism.org.au — neurodiversity-affirming resources
• PDA Parents: pdaparents.com — community
