RISKS: Pediatrician uses 'wait and see' instead of referring. Hearing test not done. Speech concerns addressed but language comprehension not assessed. Referral only to private SLP (family doesn't know about free school/Early Start services). Insurance doesn't cover evaluation or limits sessions.

