14 steps across 6 phases:
* 1 Concern & Early Indicators: Parent or Teacher Notices Academic Struggles, School Implements Classroom Interventions (Pre-Ref, Parent Requests Formal Special Education Evaluatio
* 2 Evaluation & Eligibility: Review & Sign Assessment Plan, School Conducts Psychoeducational Evaluation, Private Psychoeducational Evaluation (Optional but, Eligibility Determination — SLD Criteria
* 3 IEP Development & Services: IEP Development — SLD-Specific Goals & Services, Assistive Technology & Accommodations
* 4 504 Plan Alternative: Section 504 Plan (If IEP Denied or Preferred)
* 5 Private Services & Insurance: Private Tutoring & Educational Therapy, Medical Evaluation for Co-occurring Conditions
